OL,5,G2230 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,6,     FThe turning point of the Pacific
OL,7,     FWar, focusing on the American B-29
OL,8,     Fbombing campaign against Japan
OL,9,     Fnear the end of World War II.
OL,10,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,11,     FBea tells the women not to rely on
OL,12,     FNoeline for any favours, and Meg
OL,13,     Finvites Gail to her flat-warming
OL,14,     Fparty, only for Gail's husband to
OL,15,     Fmake a scene about Gail's
OL,16,     Fparenting.
OL,17,G0000 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,18,     FJudy tells Noeline that Margo is
OL,19,     Fon to them, Meg worries about Gail
OL,20,     Fand her family, and Vera notices
OL,21,     Fthat Lizzie hasn't run out of
OL,22,     Fcigarettes.
